        'Joshua 18:1; 1 Samuel 3:21; Joshua 9:3-15; 10:12; 1 Samuel 7:5-6; 2 Kings 25:23; 1 Kings 21:1; Hosea 1:4; 1 Samuel 27:6; 30:1; 1 Samuel 24:1-4; 1 Samuel 7:12; Judges 12:6; Acts 13:1; Acts 13:1; Romans 16:21',
