clue":"Which queen mother (Gebirah) of Judah was stripped of her royal dignity by King Asa because she had erected an abominable image for Asherah?","reference":"1 Kings 15:13","direction":"across"},{"number":10,"answer":"CANDACE","clue":"Which royal title and name belonged to the queen of the Ethiopians whose chief court treasurer was baptized by Philip on the desert road?","reference":"Acts 8:27","direction":"down"}],"crosswordVersion":5,"category":"Places and Events","stage":3,"stage_title":"Places and Events","level_theme":"Miracles and Wonders","difficulty":"Hard","timerSeconds":200,"clueCount":10,"curated":true}'::jsonb
