im, but was later stabbed to death by Joab at Hebron''s city gate?","reference":"2 Samuel 2:8; 2 Samuel 3:27","direction":"across"},{"number":10,"answer":"MANAEN","clue":"Which Christian teacher in Antioch was intimately connected to royalty, having been brought up with (a foster-brother of) Herod the tetrarch?","reference":"Acts 13:1","direction":"down"}],"crosswordVersion":5,"category":"Scripture Knowledge","stage":5,"stage_title":"Scripture Knowledge","level_theme":"Scripture Detective","difficulty":"Very Hard","timerSeconds":170,"clueCount":10,"curated":true}'::jsonb
