f Judah stole away baby prince Joash when Queen Mother Athaliah was slaughtering all royal heirs, hiding him in the temple?","reference":"2 Kings 11:2","direction":"across"},{"number":10,"answer":"ABNERSONOFNER","clue":"Who was Saul''s commander-in-chief who crowned Saul''s son Ish-bosheth king at Mahanaim, but was later stabbed to death by Joab at Hebron''s city gate?","reference":"2 Samuel 2:8; 2 Samuel 3:27","direction":"down"}],"crosswordVersion":5,"category":"Difficult Crossword","stage":7,"stage_title":"Difficult Crossword","level_theme":"Prophets and Their Assignments","difficulty":"Difficult","timerSeconds":140,"clueCount":10,"curated":true}'::jsonb
