        'EHUD|ZACCHAEUS|ZERUIAH|GAMALIEL|EPAPHRODITUS|ADONIZEDEK|HULDAH|JOANNA|PUAH|BEZALEL',
        '1. EHUD: • I was a judge in Israel.
