aoh''s order to kill infant boys?","reference":"Exodus 1:15-17","direction":"across"},{"number":10,"answer":"BEZALEL","clue":"Which master craftsman of the tribe of Judah was the son of Uri, son of Hur, appointed by God to build the ark of the covenant and tabernacle furnishings?","reference":"Exodus 31:1-5; 35:30","direction":"down"}],"crosswordVersion":5,"category":"Bible Investigator","stage":8,"stage_title":"Bible Investigator","level_theme":"Who Said It?","difficulty":"Expert","timerSeconds":140,"clueCount":10,"curated":true}'::jsonb
