        '"The Philistine lords cut Samson's hair with golden shears in Gaza","Delilah called for a man, and she caused him to shave off the seven locks of Samson's head","Samson had only three locks of hair, not seven","Samson cut his own hair after Delilah bound him with green withs"'::text[],
