        '"David was their maternal uncle (their mother Zeruiah was David's sister)","David was their cousin through his uncle Shimea","David was their father through three different concubines","David was their younger brother born to Jesse's second wife"'::text[],
        'David was their maternal uncle (their mother Zeruiah was David''s sister)',
        '1 Chronicles 2:16 states that Zeruiah and Abigail were the sisters of David, and the sons of Zeruiah were Abishai, Joab, and Asahel, three. David was their uncle.',
