        '{"puzzle_type":"Family Puzzle","clues":["Joab, Abishai, and Asahel were brothers, sons of a woman named Zeruiah.","1 Chronicles 2:16 identifies Zeruiah as a sister of King David.","Therefore, David was their maternal uncle."],"hint":"Zeruiah was David''s sister; her three mighty sons were David''s nephews.","stage":2,"category":"People and Connections","level_theme":"Family Connections","difficulty":"Moderate","timerSeconds":30,"curated":true}'::jsonb
