1. 300 men blow trumpets and break pitchers concealing torches.
2. Men shout: "The sword of the LORD, and of Gideon!"
3. The LORD sets every Midianite''s sword against his fellow in confusion.
4. Midianite army flees to Beth-shittah and Abel-meholah.',
        '"Blow trumpets & break pitchers → Shout \"Sword of the LORD & Gideon\" → Enemy turns swords on each other → Midian army flees","Midian army flees → Blow trumpets & break pitchers → Shout \"Sword of the LORD & Gideon\" → Enemy turns swords on each other","Enemy turns swords on each other → Midian army flees → Blow trumpets & break pitchers → Shout \"Sword of the LORD & Gideon\"","Shout \"Sword of the LORD & Gideon\" → Enemy turns swords on each other → Midian army flees → Blow trumpets & break pitchers"'::text[],
