        'Judges 7:19–22: The pitchers were broken revealing flaming torches; the trumpet blast and shout rang out; God threw the camp into panic turning each man''s sword against his fellow; the host fled.',
        'Judges 7:19–22',
        '{"puzzle_type":"Story Sequence Puzzle","clues":["Gideon divided his 300 men into three companies holding torches inside pitchers.","At the beginning of the middle watch they blew trumpets and smashed pitchers.","The sudden noise and blaze caused the enemy to slaughter each other."],"hint":"Pitchers broke first to reveal the torches, followed by the battle cry.","stage":3,"category":"Stories and Events","level_theme":"Story Sequence Puzzles","difficulty":"Moderate","timerSeconds":30,"curated":true}'::jsonb
