4. The wall of the city falls down flat and each soldier marches straight ahead.',
        '"Wall falls flat → March once daily for 6 days → Compass 7 times on 7th day → Long blast & great shout","Long blast & great shout → Wall falls flat → March once daily for 6 days → Compass 7 times on 7th day","March once daily for 6 days → Compass 7 times on 7th day → Long blast & great shout → Wall falls flat","Compass 7 times on 7th day → Wall falls flat → March once daily for 6 days → Long blast & great shout"'::text[],
        'March once daily for 6 days → Compass 7 times on 7th day → Long blast & great shout → Wall falls flat',
