        '"Ebed-Melech","Pashhur","Jehudi","Gedaliah"'::text[],
        'Ebed-Melech',
        'Ebed-Melech the Ethiopian heard that they had put Jeremiah into the cistern. He went from the king''s palace, spoke to Zedekiah, and safely hauled Jeremiah out of the mud with ropes and cushioned rags. God promised to spare his life when Jerusalem fell.',
