        '"Baruch","Gera","Hilkiah","Seraiah"'::text[],
        'Baruch',
        'Jeremiah called Baruch the son of Neriah, and Baruch wrote on a scroll at the dictation of Jeremiah all the words of the Lord. When King Jehoiakim cut it with a penknife and burned it in the hearth, Baruch rewrote the entire scroll at Jeremiah''s direction.',
