        '"Hazael","Gehazi","Benaiah","Adoram"'::text[],
        'Gehazi',
        'Gehazi, the servant of Elisha the man of God, pursued Naaman, lied to him to extract two talents of silver and two changes of clothing, and hid them in the house. Elisha exposed him: "The leprosy of Naaman shall cling to you and to your descendants forever."',
