        'Rahab: scarlet cord; Tamar: signet and cord; Shunammite: prophet''s furnished room',
        'Rahab tied the scarlet cord in her window in Joshua 2. Tamar asked for Judah''s signet, cord, and staff in Genesis 38:18. The wealthy Shunammite woman prepared an upper room with bed, table, stool, and candlestick for Elisha in 2 Kings 4:10.',
