        'Philip: Samaria & Ethiopian; Stephen: First martyr; Nicolas: Proselyte of Antioch',
        'Acts 6:5 lists Stephen, Philip, and Nicolas a proselyte of Antioch. Stephen was martyred in Acts 7. Philip evangelized Samaria and the Ethiopian court official in Acts 8.',
        'Acts 6:5; Acts 7:54–60; Acts 8:4–40',
        '{"puzzle_type":"Bible Logic Grid","clues":["Preached in Samaria and on the road to Gaza: Philip.","Stoned outside Jerusalem while gazing into heaven: Stephen.","Proselyte from Antioch chosen among the seven: Nicolas."],"hint":"Philip was the evangelist; Stephen was the first martyr; Nicolas was from Antioch.","stage":6,"category":"The Logic Chamber","level_theme":"Logic Grid Deductions","difficulty":"hard","timerSeconds":25,"curated":true}'::jsonb
