        '"Joash: In his own palace; Amaziah: Beth-millo; Amon: Lachish","Joash: Beth-millo; Amaziah: In his own palace; Amon: Lachish","Joash: Lachish; Amaziah: In his own palace; Amon: Beth-millo","Joash: Beth-millo on way to Silla; Amaziah: Lachish; Amon: In his own palace"'::text[],
