        '"Joshua forgot to seek the counsel of the high priest Eleazar with the Urim","The Ark of the Covenant was left behind in the camp at Gilgal","The Gibeonites deceived Joshua with dry bread and worn shoes","Achan stole a beautiful cloak of Shinar, 200 shekels of silver, and a bar of gold"'::text[],
