(
        'bible-puzzles-l34-c5',
        'bible-puzzles',
        34,
        5,
        'PLAUSIBLE COUNTERFEITS:
Which of these statements is a genuine verse from the Book of Proverbs?',
        '"\"To thine own self be true, and it must follow as the night the day\"","\"A rolling stone gathers no moss\"","\"Early to bed and early to rise makes a man healthy, wealthy, and wise\"","\"Iron sharpens iron, and one man sharpens another\""'::text[],
        '"Iron sharpens iron, and one man sharpens another"',
