        'Proverbs 27:17',
        '{"puzzle_type":"Spot the Biblical Mistake","clues":["Three are secular quotes (from Shakespeare, Aesop, or Poor Richard''s Almanack).","One is an authentic inspired proverb of King Solomon found in Proverbs 27."],"hint":"Proverbs 27:17 compares mutual accountability to sharpening blades of iron.","stage":7,"category":"The Scripture Trap","level_theme":"Plausible Counterfeits","difficulty":"medium","timerSeconds":25,"curated":true}'::jsonb
