        '"Abraham called the name of the place The Lord Will Provide (Jehovah-jireh)","Abraham looked and beheld behind him a ram caught in a thicket by its horns","The angel of the Lord called to Abraham a second time from heaven","Abraham sacrificed a young female lamb caught in the branches"'::text[],
        'Abraham sacrificed a young female lamb caught in the branches',
        'Genesis 22:13 explicitly states: "And Abraham lifted up his eyes and looked, and behold, behind him was a ram, caught in a thicket by his horns. And Abraham went and took the ram and offered it up a burnt offering instead of his son."',
        'Genesis 22:13–14',
        '{"puzzle_type":"Spot the Biblical Mistake","clues":["Abraham said to his young men: \"Stay here with the donkey; I and the boy will go yonder and worship and come again to you.\"","Isaac carried the wood for the burnt offering.","What animal was caught in the thicket by its horns to replace Isaac?"],"hint":"It was a male adult ram with horns, not a female lamb.","stage":7,"category":"The Scripture Trap","level_theme":"Scripture Trap Boss","difficulty":"master","timerSeconds":20,"curated":true}'::jsonb
