        'bible-puzzles',
        35,
        3,
        'SCRIPTURE TRAP BOSS:
Which of these accounts from the Book of Daniel contains an IMPOSSIBLE HISTORICAL ERROR?',
        '"Daniel prayed toward Jerusalem three times a day at his open window despite the royal ban","King Darius was tricked by his satraps into signing a 30-day irrevocable decree against praying to any god except himself","King Cyrus threw Nebuchadnezzar into the lion's den for eating grass like a beast","God sent His angel and shut the lions' mouths so that no hurt was found on Daniel"'::text[],
        'King Cyrus threw Nebuchadnezzar into the lion''s den for eating grass like a beast',
        'Nebuchadnezzar was never thrown into a lion''s den; Daniel was thrown into the lion''s den under King Darius the Mede in Daniel 6.',
