        '"Othniel was Caleb's younger brother/nephew; Caleb gave him his daughter Achsah as his wife","Othniel was Caleb's adopted son; Caleb gave him the hill country of Ephraim","Othniel was Caleb's grandson; Caleb gave him the city of Hebron","Othniel was Caleb's father-in-law; Caleb gave him forty chariots of iron"'::text[],
