        'Matthew 1 includes four non-Israelite women with extraordinary stories of grace: Tamar (v. 3), Rahab (v. 5), Ruth (v. 5), and "the wife of Uriah" (Bathsheba, v. 6), leading up to Mary (v. 16).',
