        '"All four: The Passover Lamb, Abraham's Moriah ram/lamb, Isaiah's Suffering Servant Lamb, and the Daily Tamid temple sacrifice","Only the Roman imperial sacrifice","Only the scapegoat of the Day of Atonement","Only the red heifer of Numbers 19"'::text[],
        'All four: The Passover Lamb, Abraham''s Moriah ram/lamb, Isaiah''s Suffering Servant Lamb, and the Daily Tamid temple sacrifice',
