        'bible-puzzles',
        45,
        1,
        'EXPERT PUZZLE BOSS:
Three prominent kings of Judah died as a direct consequence of battle injuries or foolish foreign warfare. Deduce the correct match:
1. King Ahaziah of Judah
2. King Jehoshaphat of Judah
3. King Josiah of Judah',
        '"Ahaziah: Shot by archers at Megiddo; Jehoshaphat: Shot at Gur; Josiah: Spared at Ramoth-gilead","Ahaziah: Shot at Gur; Jehoshaphat: Shot by archers at Megiddo; Josiah: Spared at Ramoth-gilead","Ahaziah: Spared at Ramoth-gilead; Jehoshaphat: Shot by archers at Megiddo; Josiah: Shot at Gur","Ahaziah: Shot in chariot fleeing Jehu at Gur; Jehoshaphat: Spared when cried out at Ramoth-gilead; Josiah: Shot by archers at Megiddo opposing Pharaoh Neco"'::text[],
        'Ahaziah: Shot in chariot fleeing Jehu at Gur; Jehoshaphat: Spared when cried out at Ramoth-gilead; Josiah: Shot by archers at Megiddo opposing Pharaoh Neco',
        'Ahaziah was wounded by Jehu''s men at Gur and died at Megiddo (2 Kings 9). Jehoshaphat was surrounded at Ramoth-gilead but spared (1 Kings 22). Josiah disguised himself at Megiddo against Pharaoh Neco, was struck by archers, and died (2 Chron 35).',
        '2 Kings 9:27–28; 1 Kings 22:30–33; 2 Chronicles 35:20–24',
        '{"puzzle_type":"Bible Logic Grid","clues":["One allied with Ahab at Ramoth-gilead, wore his royal robes while Ahab disguised himself, was surrounded by Syrian chariot captains who thought he was Ahab, but cried out and was rescued.","One went out to confront Pharaoh Neco of Egypt at Megiddo in disguise despite God''s warning, was shot by archers, and died in Jerusalem.","One visited wounded King Joram of Israel at Jezreel, was pursued and shot in his chariot by Jehu''s commanders at the ascent of Gur near Ibleam, and fled to Megiddo where he died."],"hint":"Josiah died at Megiddo from Neco''s archers; Ahaziah was mortally wounded during Jehu''s purge.","stage":9,"category":"The Expert Puzzle Room","level_theme":"Expert Puzzle Boss","difficulty":"master","timerSeconds":20,"curated":true}'::jsonb
