        'EXPERT PUZZLE BOSS:
What unique historical synchronism links the death of King Uzziah (Azariah) of Judah to the divine call of the prophet Isaiah?',
        '"Uzziah executed Isaiah with a wooden saw","Isaiah was Uzziah's high priest who struck him with leprosy","Uzziah died on the very day Isaiah was born in Jerusalem","Isaiah's vision of the Lord and seraphim occurred \"In the year that King Uzziah died\""'::text[],
        'Isaiah''s vision of the Lord and seraphim occurred "In the year that King Uzziah died"',
