        '"Peter wrote the Epistle to the Hebrews from Babylon while serving as high priest in Jerusalem","Peter raised a disciple named Tabitha (Dorcas) from the dead at Joppa after praying on his knees","Paul opposed Peter to his face at Antioch because Peter drew back and separated himself from eating with Gentile believers","Peter was miraculously delivered from prison on the eve of his execution by an angel who struck him on the side"'::text[],
        'Peter wrote the Epistle to the Hebrews from Babylon while serving as high priest in Jerusalem',
