(
        'bible-puzzles-l48-c3',
        'bible-puzzles',
        48,
        3,
        'ULTIMATE LOGIC GRID:
Four men in Scripture were raised from the dead in remarkable circumstances:
1. The widow of Zarephath''s son
2. The Shunammite woman''s son
3. Lazarus of Bethany
4. Eutychus of Troas
Match each person raised to the prophet or apostle God used to raise them:',
        '"Widow of Zarephath's son: Peter; Shunammite's son: John; Lazarus: Jesus; Eutychus: Philip","Widow of Zarephath's son: Jesus; Shunammite's son: Paul; Lazarus: Elijah; Eutychus: Elisha","Widow of Zarephath's son: Elijah; Shunammite's son: Elisha; Lazarus: Jesus; Eutychus: Paul","Widow of Zarephath's son: Elisha; Shunammite's son: Elijah; Lazarus: Paul; Eutychus: Jesus"'::text[],
        'Widow of Zarephath''s son: Elijah; Shunammite''s son: Elisha; Lazarus: Jesus; Eutychus: Paul',
        'Elijah raised the Zarephath widow''s son (1 Kings 17). Elisha raised the Shunammite''s boy (2 Kings 4). Jesus raised Lazarus after four days (John 11). Paul embraced and restored young Eutychus at Troas (Acts 20).',
        '1 Kings 17:17–24; 2 Kings 4:32–37; John 11:38–44; Acts 20:9–12',
        '{"puzzle_type":"Bible Logic Grid","clues":["Widow''s son at Zarephath: Elijah stretched himself upon the child three times.","Shunammite''s son: Elisha lay on the child, mouth to mouth, eyes to eyes, until the flesh grew warm and the boy sneezed seven times.","Lazarus of Bethany: Jesus called him out from the tomb after four days.","Eutychus: Paul fell upon him and embraced him after he fell from the third-story window while Paul preached until midnight."],"hint":"Zarephath = Elijah; Shunammite = Elisha; Lazarus = Jesus; Eutychus = Paul.","stage":10,"category":"The Ultimate Bible Puzzle","level_theme":"Ultimate Logic Grid","difficulty":"hard","timerSeconds":20,"curated":true}'::jsonb
