        49,
        2,
        'BIBLE PUZZLE MASTER:
FORENSIC MASTER INVESTIGATION:
- I was the priest of Midian, also known in Scripture by the name Reuel.
- Moses fled Egypt to my land and watered my daughters'' flock at the well.
- I gave my daughter Zipporah to Moses as his wife.
- Later, when Moses led Israel out of Egypt, I brought his wife and two sons (Gershom and Eliezer) to him in the wilderness.
- Observing Moses sitting from morning till evening judging disputes alone, I gave him brilliant administrative counsel to appoint leaders of thousands, hundreds, fifties, and tens.
Who am I?',
