        '2 Samuel 15:12, 31; 16:23; 17:1–23',
        '{"puzzle_type":"The Bible Detective","clues":["David''s brilliant former counselor who joined Absalom.","Grandfather of Bathsheba (daughter of Eliam).","Hanged himself when his strategic advice was thwarted by Hushai."],"hint":"David''s traitorous counselor Ahithophel.","stage":10,"category":"The Ultimate Bible Puzzle","level_theme":"Bible Puzzle Master","difficulty":"hard","timerSeconds":20,"curated":true}'::jsonb
