        'BIBLE PUZZLE MASTER:
FORENSIC MASTER INVESTIGATION:
- I was a wealthy Roman centurion of the Italian Cohort stationed in the seaside administrative capital of Caesarea.
- I was a devout man who feared God with all my household, gave alms generously to the Jewish people, and prayed continually to God.
