        'bible-puzzles',
        50,
        1,
        'PUZZLE GRANDMASTER FINALE:
GRANDMASTER MULTI-VARIABLE LOGIC:
Four Old Testament men were uniquely translated, preserved alive, or miraculously taken up without ordinary grave burial:
