        50,
        2,
        'PUZZLE GRANDMASTER FINALE:
GRANDMASTER CHRONOLOGICAL SYNTHESIS:
Arrange the ten major biblical eras in accurate chronological order from start to finish:
1. Creation & Primeval History
2. Patriarchs (Abraham, Isaac, Jacob)
3. Exodus & Wilderness Wanderings
4. Conquest of Canaan under Joshua
5. Period of the Judges
6. United Monarchy (Saul, David, Solomon)
7. Divided Kingdom (Israel & Judah)
8. Babylonian Exile
9. Post-Exilic Restoration under Persia
10. New Testament & Apostolic Church',
        '"Creation -> United Monarchy -> Patriarchs -> Exodus -> Judges -> Divided Kingdom -> Exile -> Restoration -> Apostolic Era -> Conquest","Creation -> Exodus -> Patriarchs -> Judges -> Conquest -> United Monarchy -> Exile -> Divided Kingdom -> Restoration -> Apostolic Era","Patriarchs -> Creation -> Exodus -> Conquest -> Judges -> Divided Kingdom -> United Monarchy -> Restoration -> Exile -> Apostolic Era","Creation -> Patriarchs -> Exodus -> Conquest -> Judges -> United Monarchy -> Divided Kingdom -> Exile -> Restoration -> Apostolic Era"'::text[],
        'Creation -> Patriarchs -> Exodus -> Conquest -> Judges -> United Monarchy -> Divided Kingdom -> Exile -> Restoration -> Apostolic Era',
        'This sequence traces the true biblical timeline: Creation/Primeval (Gen 1–11) -> Patriarchs (Gen 12–50) -> Exodus/Wilderness (Exod–Deut) -> Conquest (Joshua) -> Judges (Judges–Ruth) -> United Monarchy (1–2 Sam, 1 Kgs 1–11) -> Divided Kingdom (1–2 Kgs) -> Exile (2 Kgs 25, Daniel) -> Restoration (Ezra–Neh) -> Apostolic Church (Gospels through Rev).',
        'Genesis through Revelation',
        '{"puzzle_type":"Bible Logic Grid","clues":["Examine the grand sweep of biblical redemptive history.","From Genesis to Revelation across centuries.","Does the sequence 1 to 10 represent the exact historical flow of Scripture?"],"hint":"Follow the canonical sequence from Genesis to Acts and Revelation.","stage":10,"category":"The Ultimate Bible Puzzle","level_theme":"Puzzle Grandmaster Finale","difficulty":"master","timerSeconds":20,"curated":true}'::jsonb
