        'TYPE THE NAME — MINI-BOSS RIDDLE:
I was a New Testament Christian prophet from Judea who visited Antioch and accurately predicted by the Holy Spirit that a severe famine would sweep over the entire Greco-Roman world (which occurred during the reign of Claudius Caesar). Years later in Caesarea, I met the Apostle Paul at Philip’s house, took Paul’s belt, bound my own hands and feet, and prophesied that the owner of the belt would be delivered into the hands of the Gentiles in Jerusalem. Who am I?',
        '"Barnabas","Agabus","Silas","Judas Barsabbas"'::text[],
