        11,
        1,
        'WHAT AM I?
I was an ornate garment of gold, blue, purple, and scarlet yarns, and fine twisted linen, worn over the blue robe of the high priest. On my shoulder pieces were two onyx stones engraved with the names of the twelve sons of Israel, six on each stone according to their birth, so that the high priest bore their remembrance before the Lord continually. What am I?',
        '"The Turban","The Tunic","The Sash","The Ephod"'::text[],
        'The Ephod',
