        'bible-riddles',
        11,
        2,
        'WHAT AM I?
We were two mysterious sacred lots or stones placed inside the breastplate of judgment over Aaron’s heart when he went in before the Lord. Our names translate from Hebrew as "Lights" and "Perfections," and we were consulted by the high priest to discern the divine will on national questions. What are we?',
        '"The Urim and Thummim","The Golden Bells and Pomegranates","The Two Stone Tablets","The Onyx Stones"'::text[],
        'The Urim and Thummim',
        'The Urim and Thummim were placed inside the high priest’s breastplate to determine God’s decisions and judgments.',
        'Exodus 28:30; Leviticus 8:8; 1 Samuel 28:6; Ezra 2:63',
        '{"riddle_type":"What Am I?","is_typed":false,"clues":["Placed inside the square pouch of the breastpiece.","King Saul complained that the Lord answered him neither by dreams, nor by us, nor by prophets (1 Samuel 28:6).","Ezra ruled that returning priests with uncertain genealogies could not eat holy food until a priest stood up with us."],"hint":"Sacred lots in Aaron’s breastplate meaning Lights and Perfections.","testament":"Old Testament","acceptedAlternatives":["Urim and Thummim","Urim & Thummim","The Urim and the Thummim"],"stage":3,"stage_title":"Objects and Symbols","level_theme":"Priestly Vestments & Sanctuary Symbols","difficulty":"hard","timerSeconds":30,"curated":true}'::jsonb
      ),
