        'bible-riddles',
        11,
        3,
        'WHAT AM I?
I was an intricately woven hem ornament alternating with golden bells along the lower edge of the blue robe of the ephod worn by the high priest. As Aaron ministered in the Holy Place, the bells chimed between me so that his sound would be heard when he went into the holy place before the Lord and when he came out, so that he would not die. What am I?',
        '"Pomegranates of Yarn","Acacia Knots","Golden Cherubim","Almond Blossoms"'::text[],
        'Pomegranates of Yarn',
        'Pomegranates of blue, purple, and scarlet yarn alternated with golden bells on the hem of the high priest’s robe to sound his movements in the sanctuary.',
