        'WHAT AM I?
We were three hundred ordinary household vessels of clay, each containing a burning torch hidden within our hollow interior. At the beginning of the middle watch, when Gideon gave the signal around the Midianite camp in the valley of Jezreel, our owners shattered all of us simultaneously, held the blazing torches in their left hands, blew trumpets in their right hands, and shouted, "A sword for the Lord and for Gideon!" What are we?',
        '"The Jars of Cana","Gideon’s Pitchers and Jars","Elijah’s Water Pots","Jeremiah’s Clay Flask"'::text[],
