        'WHAT AM I?
I was an unlikely, freshly discarded skeletal bone of a beast of burden that Samson grabbed from the ground at Lehi when the Spirit of the Lord rushed upon him. With me in his hand, he struck down one thousand Philistines and proclaimed a poetic riddle: "With the jawbone of a donkey, heaps upon heaps, with the jawbone of a donkey have I struck down a thousand men." What am I?',
        '"The Jawbone of a Donkey","David’s Sling","Shamgar’s Oxgoad","Jael’s Tent Peg"'::text[],
        'The Jawbone of a Donkey',
