        'WHAT AM I?
I was a secret projectile used in an open field near the stone Ezel by the crown prince of Israel to deliver life-or-death intelligence to David while King Saul sought his life. When I was shot beyond a boy, the prince called out, "Is not the arrow beyond you? Hurry! Stay not!", which was the prearranged code that David had to flee. What am I?',
        '"Jehu’s Arrow","Ahab’s Stray Arrow","David’s Spear","Jonathan’s Signal Arrow"'::text[],
