        1,
        'WHAT AM I?
I was an awe-inspiring royal seat built of pure ivory overlaid with the finest gold. I had six ascending steps, a rounded back, armrests flanked by two sculpted lions, and twelve carved lions standing on the six steps—one on each end of every step. Scripture notes that "nothing like it was ever made for any other kingdom." What am I?',
