        'TYPE THE OBJECT — MINI-BOSS RIDDLE:
I was a vision seen three times by the Apostle Peter while praying in a rooftop trance in Joppa at the sixth hour. Descending from heaven like a great linen sail held by four corners, I contained all kinds of four-footed animals, reptiles of the earth, and birds of the air. A voice commanded, "Rise, Peter; kill and eat." When Peter protested that he had never eaten anything common or unclean, the voice answered: "What God has made clean, do not call common." What am I?',
        '"The Cloud of Glory","The Ark of the Covenant","The Great Sheet Let Down by Four Corners","The Net Full of Fish"'::text[],
        'The Great Sheet Let Down by Four Corners',
        'Peter saw a great sheet descending from heaven containing unclean animals, teaching that God has cleansed the Gentiles for salvation.',
