        'WHAT AM I?
In Revelation 1, the glorified Son of Man walks in the midst of seven of us, holding seven stars in His right hand. His eyes are like a flame of fire, His voice is like the roar of many waters, and He explicitly reveals our mystery: "The seven stars are the angels of the seven churches, and the seven [...] are the seven churches." What are we?',
