        3,
        'WHAT AM I?
I was an open document held in the hand of a mighty angel who came down from heaven wrapped in a cloud with a rainbow over his head, whose right foot was on the sea and left foot on the land. When the Apostle John was told to take me from the angel’s hand and eat me, I tasted sweet as honey in his mouth, but made his stomach bitterly sour. What am I?',
