        'WHAT AM I?
I was a scroll in the right hand of Him who sat on the heavenly throne, written within and on the back, and sealed with seven unbroken wax seals. When a mighty angel proclaimed with a loud voice, "Who is worthy to open the scroll and break its seals?", no one in heaven or on earth or under the earth was able to open me or look into me, causing John to weep loudly until the Lion of the tribe of Judah prevailed to open me. What am I?',
        '"The Title Deed of the Earth","The Seven-Sealed Scroll","The Lamb’s Book of Life","The Little Scroll"'::text[],
