        1,
        'WHERE AM I?
I was an oasis in the wilderness of Shur where the thirsty Israelites arrived after three days of marching without water from the Red Sea. They could not drink my waters because they were bitterly foul, causing the people to grumble against Moses. When Moses cried to the Lord, God showed him a specific tree; when he threw it into the water, my bitter springs became sweet. What place am I?',
        '"Elim","Rephidim","Marah","Massah"'::text[],
        'Marah',
