        'bible-riddles',
        17,
        2,
        'WHERE AM I?
I was a prominent mountain on the border of the land of Edom where Moses was commanded to bring Aaron and his son Eleazar before the eyes of all the congregation. On my summit, Moses stripped Aaron of his sacred high priestly vestments and placed them upon Eleazar. Aaron died there on the mountain peak at the age of one hundred and twenty-three, and Israel mourned thirty days. What mountain am I?',
        '"Mount Hor","Mount Nebo","Mount Seir","Mount Pisgah"'::text[],
        'Mount Hor',
        'Mount Hor on the border of Edom was where Aaron was stripped of his priestly robes, died, and was buried.',
