        1,
        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was the seventh generation from Adam through Seth, father of the longest-living man recorded in Scripture.
Clue 2: I walked faithfully with God in a wicked generation for three hundred years.
Clue 3: I did not taste physical death, for Scripture records simply: "and he was not, for God took him." Who am I?',
        '"Noah","Seth","Lamech","Enoch"'::text[],
        'Enoch',
