        21,
        2,
        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was both a king and a priest of the Most High God in ancient Canaan before the Levitical priesthood existed.
Clue 2: I met Abraham after his victory over Chedorlaomer and the Mesopotamian kings, bringing out bread and wine to refresh him.
