        3,
        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was approached by an elderly servant at a well outside the city of Nahor in Aram-naharaim.
Clue 2: When asked for a sip of water from my pitcher, I immediately drew enough water to quench the thirst of all ten of his thirsty camels.
