        21,
        4,
        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was the older daughter of Laban who had tender, delicate eyes, while my younger sister was beautiful in form and face.
Clue 2: My father substituted me under the wedding veil by night, causing Jacob to wake up in the morning and realize he was married to me.
Clue 3: Though unloved by my husband, God opened my womb to bear six of Israel’s twelve tribes, including Judah (the royal messianic tribe) and Levi (the priestly tribe). Who am I?',
