        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was a Danite man of Zorah whose wife was barren and had borne no children.
Clue 2: The Angel of the Lord appeared to my wife and later to both of us, giving instructions that our promised son must be a Nazirite from the womb.
Clue 3: When I offered a young goat on a rock altar to the Lord, the Angel did a wondrous thing and ascended to heaven in the very flame of the altar, causing my wife and me to fall on our faces. Who am I?',
