        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was a Nazarite from birth endowed with supernatural physical strength whenever the Spirit of the Lord rushed upon me.
Clue 2: I tore a young lion apart with my bare hands, carried away the city gates of Gaza on my shoulders, and slew a thousand men with a donkey’s jawbone.
Clue 3: Blinded and mocked in the temple of Dagon after my hair was shorn, I prayed for one final surge of strength, pushed against the two middle pillars, and killed more at my death than in my entire life. Who am I?',
        '"Samson","Jephthah","Ehud","Gideon"'::text[],
