        'TYPE THE NAME — MINI-BOSS RIDDLE:
I was a judge of Israel from Pirathon in the land of Ephraim. Scripture highlights my prominent patriarchal status and wealth by noting that I had forty sons and thirty grandsons who rode on seventy donkeys (colts). I led Israel for eight years before dying and being buried in my native hill country of Ephraim, in the hill country of the Amalekites. Who am I?',
