        2,
        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was an Ephraimite servant of Solomon whose industry won me charge of all the forced labor of the house of Joseph.
Clue 2: Promised ten tribes by the prophet Ahijah, I became the first king of the northern kingdom of Israel.
Clue 3: Fearing that my subjects would return their loyalty to the house of David if they went to Jerusalem to worship, I forged two golden calves and set them up at Bethel and Dan, declaring: "Behold your gods, O Israel, who brought you up out of the land of Egypt!" Who am I?',
