Clue 3: I led the greatest covenant renewal and Passover celebration since the days of Samuel, destroying altars at Bethel and grinding pagan idols to dust. Who am I?',
        '"Hezekiah","Josiah","Joash","Asa"'::text[],
        'Josiah',
