        1,
        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was taken captive from Judah to Babylon as a youth of noble birth and given the Babylonian name Belteshazzar.
Clue 2: I resolved not to defile myself with the king’s royal food and wine, thriving on vegetables and water.
Clue 3: God gave me understanding in all visions and dreams; I interpreted Nebuchadnezzar’s forgotten dream of the colossal statue and spent a night untouched in a den of hungry lions. Who am I?',
