        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was a Benjamite living in Susa who adopted and raised my orphaned younger cousin Hadassah (Esther).
Clue 2: While sitting at the king’s gate, I uncovered an assassination plot by Bigthan and Teresh against King Ahasuerus.
Clue 3: I refused to bow down or pay homage to the proud Agagite prime minister Haman, and urged Esther: "Who knows whether you have not come to the kingdom for such a time as this?" Who am I?',
