        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was a grandson of King Jehoiachin (Jeconiah) of the Davidic royal line who was appointed governor of Judah by Cyrus the Great.
Clue 2: I led the first wave of 42,360 Jewish exiles returning from Babylon to Jerusalem in 538 BC and laid the foundations of the Second Temple.
