        25,
        1,
        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was one of the seven men full of the Spirit and wisdom chosen to oversee daily food distribution to Hellenistic widows in Jerusalem.
Clue 2: Full of grace and power, I did great wonders and signs, and when brought before the Sanhedrin, my face shone like the face of an angel.
Clue 3: After delivering a sweeping survey of Israel’s history of resisting the Holy Spirit, I looked up into heaven, saw Jesus standing at the right hand of God, prayed for my executioners, and became the first Christian martyr. Who am I?',
        '"Philip","Nicanor","Stephen","Prochorus"'::text[],
