        'THE THREE-CLUE CHALLENGE:
Clue 1: I was a leading brother and prophet in the Jerusalem church chosen to carry the apostolic decree of the Jerusalem Council to Antioch.
Clue 2: When Paul and Barnabas separated over John Mark, Paul selected me as his companion for his Second Missionary Journey.
Clue 3: In Philippi, I was beaten with rods, imprisoned in inner stocks, and sang hymns of praise to God alongside Paul at midnight before an earthquake opened the prison doors. Who am I?',
