        'THE THREE-CLUE RIDDLE:
Clue 1: I was a young servant girl in the home of Mary, the mother of John Mark, in Jerusalem.
Clue 2: While the church was gathered inside praying fervently through the night for the imprisoned Apostle Peter, Peter was freed by an angel and knocked on the outer courtyard gate.
Clue 3: I ran to answer the knock, recognized Peter’s voice, but in sheer joy failed to open the door, running inside to announce Peter was standing at the gate; the praying disciples told me, "You are out of your mind!" Who am I?',
