        'WHAT AM I?
We were six Levite sanctuary cities appointed by Moses and Joshua—three on the east side of the Jordan and three in Canaan proper (Kedesh, Shechem, Hebron, Bezer, Ramoth, and Golan). An accidental manslayer who killed a neighbor without premeditation could flee into our gates to escape the avenger of blood. The manslayer had to remain within our boundaries until the death of the reigning high priest, after which he could return safely to his own land. What are we?',
        '"Cities of Refuge","Cities of the Plain","Levitical Cities","Royal Cities"'::text[],
