        'WHAT AM I?
I was a special legal festival occurring every fiftieth year in Israel, inaugurated by the blowing of the ram’s horn (shofar) throughout all the land on the Day of Atonement. During my celebration, all ancestral land that had been sold reverted back to its original family owners, all Hebrew slaves were set free without ransom, and the land lay fallow without sowing or pruning. Leviticus 25:10 proclaims my motto: "Proclaim liberty throughout all the land to all its inhabitants." What year am I?',
        '"The Sabbatical Year","The Day of Atonement","The Feast of Tabernacles","The Year of Jubilee"'::text[],
