        'WHO AM I?
Do not confuse me with Melchizedek the king of Salem who blessed Abraham. My name also incorporates the royal title "Sedeq" (righteousness), but I was a wicked Amorite king of Jerusalem centuries later during the conquest of Joshua. Hearing that Gibeon had made peace with Israel, I formed a five-king Amorite alliance to attack Gibeon. Joshua marched all night, routed us at Beth-horon, and chased us as hailstones fell from heaven. We hid in a cave at Makkedah, where Joshua rolled large stones over the mouth and later executed us. Who am I?',
        '"Melchizedek","Adoni-bezek","Adoni-zedek","Hiram"'::text[],
