        41,
        1,
        'FORENSIC MONOLOGUE:
"When Israel yoked itself to Baal of Peor and wept at the doorway of the tent of meeting as a lethal plague devoured twenty-four thousand, a Simeonite prince brazenly escorted a Midianite princess into his family tent in the sight of Moses. Zealous with the holy jealousy of Yahweh, I rose up from the assembly, seized a javelin in my hand, followed them into the inner tent, and thrust both of them through the belly with a single spear strike. The plague was immediately halted, and God granted me His covenant of peace and an everlasting priesthood." Who am I?',
