        2,
        'FORENSIC MONOLOGUE:
"When King David fled Jerusalem on foot from his rebel son Absalom, I came out from Bahurim of the clan of the house of Saul, shouting curses, throwing stones at David and his elite warriors, and throwing dirt into the air. I yelled: ‘Get out, get out, you man of blood, you worthless man! The Lord has avenged on you all the blood of the house of Saul!’ Abishai asked to take off my head, but David restrained him, saying the Lord may have told me to curse. When David returned triumphant across the Jordan, I fell at his feet begging for mercy." Who am I?',
