        'THE EVENT RIDDLE:
In Jude verse 9, the author illustrates respect for angelic authority by recounting an extraordinary celestial dispute found nowhere in the Old Testament: "When the archangel [...] contended with the devil, disputing about the body of Moses, he did not presume to pronounce a blasphemous judgment, but said, ‘The Lord rebuke you.’" Which archangel contended with the devil over the hidden burial site and physical body of Moses?',
