        46,
        1,
        'THE ULTIMATE MASTER DOSSIER:
"I was a righteous king of Judah who instituted profound religious reforms, removing foreign altars and cutting down Asherim poles. In my fourteenth year, when Zerah the Ethiopian invaded with a million-man army and three hundred chariots, I cried out to Yahweh: ‘Lord, there is none like you to help, between the mighty and the weak. Help us, O Lord our God!’ God routed the million Ethiopians before us. However, in my old age, when Baasha king of Israel fortified Ramah against me, I panicked and sent silver and gold from the temple to Ben-hadad king of Syria to break his treaty. When the seer Hanani rebuked me for relying on Syria rather than God, I grew furious and threw the seer into prison stocks. In my thirty-ninth year, I developed a severe, fatal disease in my feet, yet even in my disease I sought not the Lord, but the physicians." Who am I?',
