        '{"clues":["Evidence A: Midianite raiders were destroying Israel’s crops as far as Gaza.","Evidence B: On the first night, a wool fleece on the threshing floor was soaked with a bowlful of dew while the ground stayed dry.","Evidence C: On the second night, the fleece remained completely dry while dew covered all the ground."]}'::jsonb
