        1,
        'Follow the patriarchal exodus continuation: In Genesis 50:24-25, dying Joseph made the children of Israel swear to carry his bones up from Egypt. In which subsequent book does Moses take Joseph’s bones with him as Israel marches out?',
        '"Leviticus","Joshua","Numbers","Exodus"'::text[],
        'Exodus',
