        'Follow the Bethlehem prophecy chain: Micah 5:2 prophesied: "But thou, Beth-lehem Ephratah, though thou be little among the thousands of Judah, yet out of thee shall he come forth unto me that is to be ruler in Israel." In which Gospel does Herod’s chief priests cite this exact verse to locate Christ’s birth?',
