        'Judas Iscariot betrayed Christ and hanged himself before the crucifixion (Matthew 27:3-5). The General Epistle of Jude was written by Jude (Judas), the brother of James and half-brother of Jesus (Jude 1:1; Matthew 13:55). Judas Iscariot is the broken link!',
