        'bible-chain-challenge',
        41,
        2,
        'Follow the Tabernacle master craftsmen chain: The LORD called by name a master artisan from the tribe of Judah and filled him with the Spirit of God in wisdom and workmanship to design the sanctuary. What was the name of this son of Uri, the son of Hur?',
