        4,
        'Follow the prophetess consultation chain: In 2 Kings 22, when Hilkiah the high priest found the Book of the Law in the temple, King Josiah commanded him to inquire of the LORD. Which prophetess, wife of Shallum keeper of the wardrobe, who dwelt in Jerusalem in the college, delivered the divine oracle?',
