        41,
        5,
        'Follow the heroic midwives chain: In Exodus 1:15-21, Pharaoh ordered the Hebrew midwives to kill all newborn Hebrew boys on the birthstools. Name these two courageous midwives who feared God and preserved the male infants alive:',
