        'bible-chain-challenge',
        42,
        1,
        'Follow the maternal vigil chain: In 2 Samuel 21, the Gibeonites demanded seven sons of Saul to hang them for Saul’s slaughter. Which concubine of Saul took sackcloth and spread it upon the rock, keeping vigil day and night to keep the birds of the air and beasts of the field from touching the bodies of her sons?',
