        'Follow the inheritance precedent chain: In Numbers 27, five sisters stood before Moses, Eleazar the priest, the princes, and all the congregation, arguing that their father’s name should not be done away because he had no son. Who was their father of the tribe of Manasseh?',
        '"Zelophehad","Hepher","Machir","Gilead"'::text[],
