        'bible-chain-challenge',
        42,
        4,
        'Follow the hospitable Shunammite chain: In 2 Kings 4, a prominent woman of Shunem urged her husband to build a small upper room on the wall for Elisha the holy man of God. Which four furnishings did she provide in that room?',
        '"A tent, a waterpot, an oven, and oil","An altar, an ark, a lamp, and incense","A bed, a table, a stool, and a candlestick","A couch, a basin, a robe, and sandals"'::text[],
        'A bed, a table, a stool, and a candlestick',
