        'bible-chain-challenge',
        42,
        5,
        'Follow the Kenite tent deliverance: Sisera fled on foot to the tent of Jael, wife of Heber the Kenite. What drink did Jael give Sisera when he asked only for water, before driving the tent peg through his temples?',
        '"Honey and vinegar","Olive oil","Milk in a lordly dish (bottle of milk)","Wine of Lebanon"'::text[],
