(
        'bible-chain-challenge-l43-c1',
        'bible-chain-challenge',
        43,
        1,
        'Follow Paul’s Roman imprisonment refreshment chain: In 2 Timothy 1:16-18, all who were in Asia turned away from Paul. Which faithful believer did Paul pray mercy upon, testifying: "he oft refreshed me, and was not ashamed of my chain: but, when he was in Rome, he sought me out very diligently, and found me"?',
        '"Epaphras","Philemon","Tychicus","Onesiphorus"'::text[],
        'Onesiphorus',
