        'Complete the foundation of the second great commandment in Leviticus 19:18: "Thou shalt not avenge, nor bear any grudge against the children of thy people, but thou shalt ______ ______ ______ ______: I am the LORD."',
        '"love thy neighbour as thyself","walk with an upright heart","judge thy brother in righteousness","deal kindly with the stranger"'::text[],
        'love thy neighbour as thyself',
